      "hint": "Split the first factor into 3x and 5 (top headers). Split the second into 2x and -7 (left headers). Multiply each pair to fill the cells.",
      "solution_html": "\\( 3x \\cdot 2x = 6x^2,\\; 5 \\cdot 2x = 10x,\\; 3x \\cdot (-7) = -21x,\\; 5 \\cdot (-7) = -35 \\)<br>\\( 6x^2 + (10x - 21x) - 35 = 6x^2 - 11x - 35 \\)"
